  "body": "<h2>Event Dates</h2>\n<p><strong>April 15-18, 2013</strong></p>\n<h2>The Location</h2>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.oregoncc.org/\">Oregon Convention Center</a><br /> 777 Northeast Martin Luther King Junior Boulevard<br />Portland, Oregon 97232</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.oregoncc.org/\"><img src=\"/themes/openstack/images/conferences/portland/portland-convention-center.jpg\" width=\"193\" height=\"192\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?f=q&amp;source=s_q&amp;hl=en&amp;geocode=&amp;q=Oregon+Convention+Center,+Northeast+Martin+Luther+King+Junior+Boulevard,+Portland,+OR&amp;aq=0&amp;oq=oregon+con&amp;sll=29.477608,-98.514404&amp;sspn=0.863155,1.18103&amp;vpsrc=0&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;hq=Oregon+Convention+Center,+Northeast+Martin+Luther+King+Junior+Boulevard,+Portland,+OR&amp;hnear=&amp;radius=15000&amp;ll=45.533169,-122.662868&amp;spn=0.086819,0.147629&amp;t=m&amp;z=13&amp;iwloc=A&amp;cid=6993232033891072479\"><img src=\"/themes/openstack/images/conferences/portland/portland-map.gif\" width=\"193\" height=\"192\" /></a></p>\n<h2>Recommended Hotels</h2>\n<div id=\"InfoMessage\" class=\"siteMessage\">\n<p>Update: Our room blocks have sold out.  Please contact the below hotels to reserve your room.</p>\n</div>\n<hr /><h2><a href=\"http://www3.hilton.com/en/hotels/oregon/hilton-portland-and-executive-tower-PDXPHHH/index.html\">Hilton Portland &amp; Executive Tower</a></h2>\n<hr /><h2><a href=\"http://www.marriott.com/hotels/travel/pdxct-portland-marriott-city-center/\">Portland Marriott City Center</a></h2>\n<hr /><h2><a href=\"http://doubletree3.hilton.com/en/hotels/oregon/doubletree-by-hilton-hotel-portland-RLLC-DT/index.html\">DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Portland</a></h2>\n<hr /><h2><a href=\"http://www.redlion.com/conventioncenter\">Red Lion Hotel Portland</a></h2>",
